HOLD_FLASH 1
GENESIS "NEXUS_COORD v1 | from=proof | type=resolve | hold_flash=1 |"
CUBE a ROLE peer PROTON 1
CUBE b ROLE peer PROTON 1
CUBE hive ROLE nanobot_hive PROTON 1
CUBE create ROLE construct PROTON 1
FOLDBITS a "1111000011110000111100001111000011110000111100001111000011110000"
FOLDBITS b "1111000011110000111100001111000011110000111100001111000011110000"
PLUG a b
PLUG a hive
PLUG create hive
IMPULSE create 1
ENERGYFLOW 4
RESOLVE hive
ASSERT DECIDE >= 0
ASSERT DECIDE <= 9
ASSERT HARMONY >= 0
ASSERT ENERGY > 0
PRINT "proof10" DECIDE HARMONY ENERGY
